# API source of truth

- Implement only operations documented at `/api/v1/schema/merchants/` and
  `/api/v1/docs/merchants/` on the MM Aggregator.
- Do not invent paths, headers, or error codes.
- Never put merchant API keys in frontend or plugin JavaScript.
